# Normalise to LF in the repository regardless of the platform that commits.
#
# This is written down rather than left to autocrlf because the sibling projects in this family have
# already been bitten: shipped text that is CRLF in the working tree breaks shell scripts and diffs on
# POSIX, and the discovery happens on somebody else's machine. A CI job on three platforms makes that
# mistake expensive; one line here makes it impossible.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
